    "field_description": [
        {
            "value": "Druxt's Drupal module answers for twelve JSON:API resources, hardcoded, all of them describing structure. 1.3.0 makes that list yours, and here's what I'd add to mine. Any JSON:API client benefits, not only Druxt."
